    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Antonio.<div><br></div><div>    csvtextinputformat = make.input.format(&quot;csv&quot;, sep = &quot;\\t&quot;)</div><div>This line helped to resolve this issue.<br></div><div><br></div><div>And my map reduce now directly accesses the input file</div><div>    ... mapreduce(input=input, output=output, input.format = csvtextinputformat, ...</div><div><br></div><div>This way this is resolved.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Ambika</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
